      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠪᠥᠲᠥᠺᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>bütügekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>бүтээх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>BYTYGE-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. To fulfill, matertaltze, complete, accomplish; to create, construct) produce; to evoke a deity through creative contemplation and recitation of tarni (q. v.}; to create or conjure magically. Cf. sidi.</definition>
      <page>152</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠥᠲᠥᠺᠠᠭᠴᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>- -gci</transcript>
