          <unicode>ᠪᠦᠲᠦᠭᠡᠯ ᠪᠥᠲᠥᠺᠠᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>bytygel --ky</transcript>
          <definition>(Rel.) To recite a bytygel q. v,</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠳ ᠲᠠᠸᠠᠷ ᠪᠥᠲᠥᠺᠠᠺᠦ</unicode>
